increasing the number of transmit units improves the EE due to the enhanced spatial beamforming degrees of freedom. 
Compared with the conventional fully-active multi-antenna transceiver, 
the proposed TRIS transceiver achieves a higher EE under all considered configurations. 
This is because the TRIS transceiver requires only a single RF chain, 
whereas the multi-antenna transceiver employs $N$ RF chains, 
