		Random ${\bf{F}}_{\rm{BB}}^{(2)}$ and ${\bf{W}}_{\rm{BB}}^{(2)}, {\widehat{\bf H}}, \varepsilon_{\rm eff}, N^{\rm RF}_{\rm t}, {\boldsymbol\rho}$
